        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Q. A continuing contract shall be effective at the beginning of the school fiscal year in which evidence of completing all the requirements are submitted to the Personnel Department on or before July 1 of that year. Each teacher to whom a continuing contract has been issued shall be entitled to continue in his position or in a similar position in the District at the salary schedule as set forth in this Contract or its modifications without the necessity for annual nomination or reappointment. Continuing contract as used here shall include a professional service contract of a continuing nature.",
            "block_bbox": [
