        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "T. A teacher shall not be denied reappointment for continued employment based on the anticipated expiration of his certificate. By October 1, the Personnel Department shall notify, in writing, each teacher whose certificate is expiring at the end of that school year.",
