        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "U. All bargaining unit teaching positions shall be filled with annual contract teachers, continuing contract teachers or teachers holding a professional service contract of a continuing nature. This shall not preclude the Board from hiring a teacher on temporary contract under the conditions specified in Article VIII or if the teacher is hired less than sixteen (16) student contact days prior to March 15.",
