        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "V. Participation in the Beginning Teacher Program as a peer teacher shall be voluntary except as specified below. If no qualified peer teacher volunteers at the work location to which a beginning teacher is assigned, the principal or work location supervisor may assign a teacher to act as a peer teacher. The principal or work location supervisor shall seek volunteers from all qualified teachers prior to assigning a person as a peer teacher. If the principal or work location supervisor must assign persons as peer teachers, the assignment shall be rotated on an equitable basis.",
